{"violation_type":{"id":"tx-tac-745-8411-a","jurisdiction":"TX","state":"TX","code_system":"Texas Administrative Code, Title 26, Ch. 745","original_code":"745.8411(a)","title":"Responsibilities - Not interfere with an inspection or investigation (26 TAC §745.8411(a))","short_title":"Responsibilities - Not interfere with an inspection or investigation","severities":{"high":38},"facility_ids":["tx-hhsc-742389","tx-hhsc-101329","tx-hhsc-1513805","tx-hhsc-1504655","tx-hhsc-1517221","tx-hhsc-1205538","tx-hhsc-1515905","tx-hhsc-1427234","tx-hhsc-1290870","tx-hhsc-1301028","tx-hhsc-1475774","tx-hhsc-1488624","tx-hhsc-1131883","tx-hhsc-95617","tx-hhsc-131820","tx-hhsc-309235","tx-hhsc-1261912","tx-hhsc-870249","tx-hhsc-231809","tx-hhsc-986991","tx-hhsc-171925","tx-hhsc-1529332","tx-hhsc-1397108","tx-hhsc-1499253","tx-hhsc-1368941","tx-hhsc-1515176","tx-hhsc-1404774","tx-hhsc-367066","tx-hhsc-1307755","tx-hhsc-1456752"],"first_date":"2023-12-05","last_date":"2026-08-19","typical_finding":"Recite: The child care provider was not cooperative with the investigation and inspection process even with law enforcement presence.","finding_variants":[{"text":"Recite: The child care provider was not cooperative with the investigation and inspection process even with law enforcement presence.","count":4},{"text":"During an investigation, staff was instructed on what to say and to provide false information to the Child Care Regulation Inspector during interviews.","count":3},{"text":"During the inspection, the primary caregiver did not provide access to a bedroom in the home because the room was locked. A child was later observed exiting that room, where two individuals were present who did not have a background check.","count":1},{"text":"It was found that training document dates did not align with dates of training completion.","count":1},{"text":"The operation has violated the request to cease operating during the investigation process by proceeding to operate without a permit . During the inspection conducted on 5/22/25 it was determined that the program had 21 children present although they were notified on 5/16/25 that all care must cease until a permit was obtained from our department. The operation also did not grant consent for an investigation inspection to be conducted at the operation as part of the investigation.","count":1},{"text":"Through interviews conducted during the investigation, it was determined that the operation provided caregivers with questions to answer during the course of the investigation Additionally, the operation denied DFPS entry on several occasions.","count":1}],"topic":"staffing","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances","topic_evidence":"INFERRED","primary_severity":"high","occurrence_count":38,"facility_count":30},"by_year":{"2023":1,"2024":6,"2025":22,"2026":9},"facilities":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-1513805","name":"Kimberly Brown","type":"family_home","authority":"TX HHSC","status":"licensed","city":"Nederland","zip":"77627","capacity":12,"age_groups":["infant","toddler","preschool","school_age"],"inspections":10,"last_inspection":"2026-03-06","violations":20,"open_violations":0,"severe_violations":18,"occurrences_of_type":6,"open_of_type":0},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1427234","name":"Montessori Oaks","type":"center","authority":"TX HHSC","status":"licensed","city":"Austin","zip":"78729","address":"9006 Anderson Mill Rd","capacity":102,"age_groups":["infant","toddler","preschool","school_age"],"lat":30.452726112477,"lon":-97.77794178423,"inspections":18,"last_inspection":"2026-03-31","violations":31,"open_violations":0,"severe_violations":22,"occurrences_of_type":3,"open_of_type":0},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1475774","name":"Just for Tots #2","type":"center","authority":"TX HHSC","status":"licensed","city":"Killeen","zip":"76549","address":"2901 W Elms Rd Bldg a Bldg B Ste 200 300 400","capacity":136,"age_groups":["infant","toddler","preschool","school_age"],"lat":31.093589480115,"lon":-97.779006529633,"inspections":36,"last_inspe