 the operation to cover days listed in the investigation. The operation began playing the recordings, then stated the camera and footage was messing up, preventing licensing from accessing any of the recordings. The operation however, offered to provide footage of the day prior and the day after the incident, which were not associated with the investigation.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026603784","facility_name":"Just for Tots #2"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1307755-i20260724-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-745-8411-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1307755-i20260724","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1307755","date":"2026-07-24","original_code":"745.8411(a)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","severity_rank":3,"source_category":"High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-09-25","finding":"Responsibilities - Not interfere with an inspection or investigation: The operation conducted their own investigation before making a report to Child Care Regulations.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026563009","facility_name":"Lakeview Elementary School"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1529332-i20260716-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-745-8411-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1529332-i20260716","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1529332","date":"2026-07-16","original_code":"745.8411(a)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","severity_rank":3,"source_category":"High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-07-20","finding":"Responsibilities - Not interfere with an inspection or investigation: A caregiver refused to provide her last name during the inspection. She said she did not have to provide this information to Child Care Regulation.","topic":"sanitation","source_record_id":"1026390069","facility_name":"Club Z"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1517221-i20260626-2-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-745-8411-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1517221-i20260626-2","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1517221","date":"2026-06-26","original_code":"745.8411(a)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","severity_rank":3,"source_category":"High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-10-27","finding":"Responsibilities - Not interfere with an inspection or investigation: Through interviews conducted during the investigation, it was determined that the operation provided caregivers with questions to answer during the course of the investigation Additionally, the operation denied DFPS entry on several occasions.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026614539","facility_name":"Tierra Encantada-Camp Bowie"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-986991-i20260617-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-745-8411-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-986991-i20260617","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-986991","date":"2026-06-17","original_code":"745.8411(a)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","severity_rank":3,"source_category":"High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-07-01","finding":"Responsibilities - Not interfere with an inspection or investigation: The primary caregiver did not allow for CCR to view inside gun safe to evaluate guns/ammo storage.","topic":"other","source_record_id":"1026477004","facility_name":"Dawn Trujillo"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-742389-i20260605-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-745-8411-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-742389-i20260605","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-742389","date":"2026-06-05","original_code":"745.8411(a)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","severity_rank":3,"source_category":"High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-06-17","finding":"Responsibilities - Not interfere with an inspection or investigation: During the inspection, the primary caregiver did not provide access to a bedroom in the home because the room was locked. A child was later observed exiting that room, where two individuals were present who did not have a background check.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026274238","facility_name":"Angelica  Arellano"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1475774-i20260603-v4","violation_typ