igh","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-06-20","finding":"Responsibilities - Not interfere with an inspection or investigation: The operation has violated the request to cease operating during the investigation process by proceeding to operate without a permit . During the inspection conducted on 5/22/25 it was determined that the program had 21 children present although they were notified on 5/16/25 that all care must cease until a permit was obtained from our department. The operation also did not grant consent for an investigation inspection to be conducted at the operation as part of the investigation.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026664887","facility_name":"Memorial Summer Camps and After School-Memorial Campus"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-95617-i20250411-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-745-8411-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-95617-i20250411","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-95617","date":"2025-04-11","original_code":"745.8411(a)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","severity_rank":3,"source_category":"High","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-04-22","finding":"Responsibilities - Not interfere with an inspection or investigation: CCR arrived at the facility.  CCR rang the doorbell numerous times.  CCR contacted operation staff by phone after no personnel answered the door.  Operation staff still did not come to the door.  Operation staff on the playground observed CCR waiting at the door and still did not answer.  It was approximately 8-9 minutes before CCR was allowed access to the building.  CCR was eventually allowed access inside the building by a parent, not personnel.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026336896","facility_name":"South Willis Kindercare"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-231809-i20250401-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-745-8411-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-231809-i20250401","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-231809","date":"2025-04-01","original_code":"745.8411(a)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High r